# === Judgment calls — uncomment to exclude (re-check before large backups) ===
# Downloads/                    # 153G installers/archives, often NAS-backed already
# Movies/                       # 87G media, often NAS-backed already
# Library/Application Support/  # 51G app data; keep if you want app settings restored
